{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04905","headline":"侍宴安乐公主山庄应制 · 李乂","name":"侍宴安乐公主山庄应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金舆玉辇背三条，水阁山楼望九霄。\n野外初迷七圣道，河边忽覩二灵桥。\n悬冰滴滴依虬箭，清吹泠泠杂凤箫。\n回晚平阳歌舞合，前溪更转木兰桡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李乂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04905.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04905","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}